  <!--
    An INERT, non-functional marker artifact standing in for what a hijacked
    package would look like at the coordinate level. It contains no
    executable payload, no obfuscation, and does nothing beyond exposing a
    marker resource file. The point of this experiment is to observe
    whether Maven's resolver selects this coordinate over the legitimate
